{"id":"m53297","name":"Pomegranate salad","author":"bbcgoodfood.com","source":{"name":"bbcgoodfood.com","url":"https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/pomegranate-salad"},"via":{"name":"TheMealDB","url":"https://www.themealdb.com/meal/53297"},"image":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/fqpqml1764359125.jpg","cuisine":"Polish","country":"Poland","region":"Europe","course":"main","protein":"veggie","diet":1,"minutes":30,"timeEstimated":true,"difficulty":"easy","ingredients":[{"item":"Olive Oil","qty":"60 ml"},{"item":"Lemon Juice","qty":"2 tablespoons"},{"item":"Honey","qty":"1 tablespoon"},{"item":"Thyme","qty":"2 sprigs"},{"item":"Baby Lettuce Leaves","qty":"100g"},{"item":"Cherry Tomatoes","qty":"250g"},{"item":"Spring Onions","qty":"3 chopped"},{"item":"Red Chilli","qty":"1 chopped"},{"item":"Pomegranate","qty":"1"},{"item":"Feta","qty":"50g"}],"steps":["Combine the olive oil, lemon juice, honey and thyme leaves in a large bowl. Season well, then tip in the lettuce, tomatoes, spring onions and chilli, and toss to combine.","Scoop out the pomegranate seeds over a bowl and remove any white membrane. Arrange the dressed salad on a platter, then scatter over the pomegranate seeds and feta."],"tags":[],"youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wTqashUAid8","culture":null,"license":"TheMealDB"}